name: Talisman — gold seal
author: corpus
description: >-
  Talisman adds a Gold Seal to 1 selected card. First-shop spectral seal engine: pair
  with Golden Ticket, Midas Mask, and Pareidolia.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - spectralCard: Talisman
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: GoldenTicket
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: MidasMask
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Pareidolia
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
